Suggests: tailscale, tor, fprintd, power-profiles-daemon, accountsservice, pavucontrol
Description: eDEX-DE - sci-fi desktop shell for Hyprland
 A Rust + wgpu shell drawn on Hyprland's layer shell in the style of eDEX-UI:
 terminal, file browser, system dashboard, on-screen keyboard, launcher,
 settings, privacy panel, notification server and a greetd greeter.
 .
 The Debian package is built by CI but eDEX-DE is developed and tested on
 Arch/CachyOS; Hyprland 0.55+ with Lua configuration is required.
